399389-06:00, done=true, story_Points=7}, ToDoItem{id=82, title='Java and Springboot Study', moduleId=41, description='Study about the technologies that are going to be necessary to develop the final solution for the client. ', dateLimit=null, responsible=2, endingDate=null, estimatedTime=4, actualTime=null, creation_ts=2025-04-05T14:49:35.489336-06:00, done=false, story_Points=7}, ToDoItem{id=83, title='Initial code deployment.', moduleId=41, description='Time to understand the code provided by oracle and do the initial code deployment in order to understand all the OCI concepts studied. ', dateLimit=null, responsible=1, endingDate=null, estimatedTime=4, actualTime=5, creation_ts=2025-04-05T14:50:06.709560-06:00, done=true, story_Points=8}]}, Module{id=42, title='Getting Close To Oracle', body='Sprint to Start the initial phase of the development process', categoryId=1, status=1, severity=2, startDate=2025-04-05, dateLimit=2025-04-19, parentModule=null, tasks=[ToDoItem{id=87, title='Creation of work repo', moduleId=42, description='Creation of a work repo in which each member is capable of adding their own branches', dateLimit=null, responsible=1, endingDate=null, estimatedTime=1, actualTime=2, creation_ts=2025-04-05T14:53:31.323043-06:00, done=true, story_Points=2}, ToDoItem{id=89, title='Select the change to do for first period.', moduleId=42, description='Time to analyze the code provided by ORACLE and identify the opportunity areas that this can have. ', dateLimit=null, responsible=5, endingDate=null, estimatedTime=2, actualTime=6, creation_ts=2025-04-05T14:54:39.768315-06:00, done=true, story_Points=3}, ToDoItem{id=90, title='Development of the final presentation 1st Period', moduleId=42, description='Time to develop the final presentation with the initial final project proposal, highlighting the changes that we consider that are going to improve the productivity of ORACLE teams and also are going to decrease the expenses of ORACLE as company. ', dateLimit=nul